<import src="../../errands/f7-common.wxml" />
<view class="errand-page errand-composer f7-ios-theme"><template is="errand-campus" data="{{regionLabel,campusQuery,campuses,busy,frozen,configured,uiPanels}}" /><template is="errand-status" data="{{status,error,receiptStatus,frozen,recoveryOperation,busy,confirmedOrderId}}" /><view wx:if="{{loaded &amp;&amp; !frozen}}"><wu-f7-block class="errand-compose-main" strong="{{true}}" inset="{{true}}" spacing="compact"><wu-f7-input class="errand-title-input" data-field="title" value="{{form.title}}" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{busy || imagePublication.busy || imagePublication.frozen}}" placeholder="需要同学帮你做什么？" bind:input="onForm" /><view class="errand-field-count">标题 · {{formCounts.title}}/50</view><textarea class="errand-description-input" data-field="publicText" value="{{form.publicText}}" bindinput="onForm" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{busy || imagePublication.busy || imagePublication.frozen}}" placeholder="写清取送地点、物品和具体要求，方便同学接单" /><view class="errand-field-count">公开描述 · {{formCounts.publicText}}/500</view></wu-f7-block><wu-f7-block class="errand-form-section" strong="{{true}}" inset="{{true}}" spacing="compact"><view class="errand-field-row"><text class="errand-field-label">期望时间</text><wu-f7-input data-field="expectedTimeText" value="{{form.expectedTimeText}}" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{busy || imagePublication.busy || imagePublication.frozen}}" placeholder="例如今晚八点前 · 最多50字" bind:input="onForm" /></view><view class="errand-field-row"><text class="errand-field-label">跑腿报酬</text><text class="errand-money-symbol">¥</text><wu-f7-input data-field="reward" value="{{form.reward}}" maxlength="101" disabled="{{busy || imagePublication.busy || imagePublication.frozen}}" placeholder="1–500元，可填写小数" bind:input="onForm" /></view></wu-f7-block><wu-f7-block class="errand-form-section" strong="{{true}}" inset="{{true}}" spacing="compact"><view class="errand-section-header"><view class="errand-section-title">联系方式</view><wu-f7-button class="errand-text-button" disabled="{{busy || imagePublication.busy || imagePublication.frozen}}" bind:press="onPublisherContacts">使用上次信息</wu-f7-button></view><view class="errand-footnote">接单后向对方显示，订单结束后隐藏。微信和电话均需填写。</view><view class="errand-field-row"><text class="errand-field-label">微信</text><wu-f7-input data-field="wechat" value="{{form.wechat}}" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{busy || imagePublication.busy || imagePublication.frozen}}" placeholder="填写微信号 · 最多50字" bind:input="onForm" /></view><view class="errand-field-row"><text class="errand-field-label">电话</text><wu-f7-input data-field="phone" value="{{form.phone}}" maxlength="11" type="number" disabled="{{busy || imagePublication.busy || imagePublication.frozen}}" placeholder="填写联系电话 · 最多11位" bind:input="onForm" /></view></wu-f7-block><wu-f7-block class="errand-form-section" strong="{{true}}" inset="{{true}}" spacing="compact"><wu-f7-button class="errand-disclosure" data-field="private" disabled="{{busy || imagePublication.busy || imagePublication.frozen}}" bind:press="onTogglePanel"><wu-icon name="lock" size="19" /><text>给接单者的私密说明</text><text class="errand-optional">选填</text><wu-icon name="{{uiPanels.private ? 'chevron-up' : 'chevron-down'}}" size="14" /></wu-f7-button><view wx:if="{{uiPanels.private}}"><view class="errand-footnote">仅你与接单者可见，订单结束后仍保留。</view><textarea class="errand-private-input" data-field="privateText" value="{{form.privateText}}" bindinput="onForm" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{busy || imagePublication.busy || imagePublication.frozen}}" placeholder="例如取件码、详细位置 · 最多200字" /></view></wu-f7-block><wu-f7-block class="errand-form-section" strong="{{true}}" inset="{{true}}" spacing="compact"><wu-f7-button class="errand-disclosure" data-field="images" disabled="{{busy || imagePublication.busy || imagePublication.frozen}}" bind:press="onTogglePanel"><wu-icon name="image" size="19" /><text>添加图片</text><text class="errand-optional">选填</text><wu-icon name="{{uiPanels.images ? 'chevron-up' : 'chevron-down'}}" size="14" /></wu-f7-button><view wx:if="{{uiPanels.images}}"><view class="errand-footnote">公开、私密图片各最多3张，审核后发布。私密图片仅双方可见。</view><view wx:for="{{imagePublication.images}}" wx:key="slot" class="errand-image-slot"><view class="errand-image-label"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text class="errand-optional">{{item.ready ? '已选择' : '未选择'}}</text></view><view class="errand-inline-actions"><wu-f7-button class="errand-text-button" data-value="{{item.slot}}" disabled="{{busy || imagePublication.busy || imagePublication.frozen}}" bind:press="onChooseOrderImage">{{item.ready ? '更换' : '选择'}}</wu-f7-button><wu-f7-button class="errand-text-button" data-value="{{item.slot}}" disabled="{{busy || imagePublication.busy || imagePublication.frozen}}" bind:press="onRecoverOrderImage">恢复上传</wu-f7-button><wu-f7-button class="errand-text-button errand-muted" data-value="{{item.slot}}" disabled="{{busy || imagePublication.busy || imagePublication.frozen}}" bind:press="onRemoveOrderImage">移除</wu-f7-button></view></view></view></wu-f7-block><view class="errand-publish-area"><view class="errand-footnote">报酬由双方线下结算，这里不产生线上付款。</view><wu-f7-button class="errand-primary" disabled="{{busy || imagePublication.busy || !regionId}}" loading="{{busy}}" bind:press="onPublish" variant="fill" size="large">发布跑腿</wu-f7-button></view></view><wu-f7-block wx:if="{{imagePublication.hasDraft || imagePublication.message}}" class="errand-recovery" strong="{{true}}" inset="{{true}}" spacing="compact"><view class="errand-section-title">图片草稿</view><view class="errand-footnote">{{imagePublication.message}}</view><view wx:if="{{imagePublication.frozen}}" class="errand-footnote">发布结果待确认，图片暂不能更改。请先查询结果或继续原发布。</view><wu-f7-button class="errand-text-button" disabled="{{imagePublication.busy}}" bind:press="onRecoverImagePublication">恢复图片草稿或发布结果</wu-f7-button><wu-f7-button wx:if="{{imagePublication.frozen}}" class="errand-primary" disabled="{{imagePublication.busy}}" bind:press="onRetryImagePublication" variant="fill" size="large">继续原发布</wu-f7-button><wu-f7-button wx:if="{{imagePublication.hasDraft}}" class="errand-text-button errand-danger" disabled="{{imagePublication.busy}}" bind:press="onCancelImageDraft" tone="danger">撤回原图片草稿</wu-f7-button><navigator wx:if="{{imagePublication.confirmedOrderId}}" class="errand-toolbar-link" url="/pages/errand-detail/errand-detail?orderId={{imagePublication.confirmedOrderId}}">查看已发布订单</navigator></wu-f7-block></view>
